Choose how many batches of a known recipe to make at a crafting station. The menu shows the ingredients and the expected output before you confirm.

[b]Supported campaign[/b]
Gothic II: Night of the Raven with Marcello L’Hiver DE 2.0.4 only. Starting with version 0.0.67, batch crafting stays idle if the active scripts differ and Marcello L’Hiver is not selected.

[b]Workshop setup[/b]
Subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2787458679]Union[/url] and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2847787799]Marcello L’Hiver DE[/url]. Enable Union and this addon in the Workshop Launcher, select Marcello L’Hiver DE and start the game.

If you previously installed the plugin manually, close Gothic and remove the loose [b]system/autorun/UnionBatchCraftingExtended.dll[/b] before enabling the addon.

The plugin code is MIT-licensed. [url=https://github.com/ne1800/union-batch-crafting]Browse the source code on GitHub[/url]. Steam supplies the playable addon and its licence notices.
